+          Send a token as <code className="font-mono">Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code> to use the JSON API
+          as yourself. Each token allows 60 requests per minute.
+        </p>
+      </header>
+
+      {created ? (
+        <div className="space-y-2 border-y border-g-line py-3 text-sm">
+          <p className="text-g-text">
+            Token <strong>{created.name}</strong> created. Copy it now — it will not be shown again.
+          </p>
+          <code className="block break-all rounded-g-ctl bg-g-line px-3 py-2 font-mono text-xs text-g-heading">
